.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">구비서류</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">[</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지원서 작성안내</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">를 참고하여 작성을 한 후에</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 2013</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">12</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일까